body:

**Hybrid Cloud (AWS & On-Prem) · Kubernetes · Backend Engineering · Healthcare Systems**
<br><br>
My work spans DevOps leadership, platform engineering, and hands-on backend development, I currently focus on healthcare platforms, hospital integrations (PACS, HL7, LIS), and distributed Kubernetes environments.
<br><br> 
Based in Thailand; open to remote and hybrid opportunities.
If you'd like to connect, please feel free to send me a <a href="mailto:bomm.mongkon@gmail.com">Send Email</a>
<br><br>
I enjoy solving infrastructure and architecture problems, but I still write code and build systems myself.

